data.creator_notes:
@LonewolfX3000 is an interesting guy, but he doesn't have any idea on how to make good bots, he just seems to churn them out without testing. This is my attempt to make the "Nanites/Nanomachines" idea of his work.

I'm really quite a noob at making these things, but I'm trying to refine the behavior bit by bit, despite honestly being quite uncomfortable with the material I am working with here.

I'd appreciate a public chat to see if I have to adjust some behavior, or just leave a comment.
